# CampusFlow --- Enterprise Engineering Roadmap

## Project Goal

CampusFlow is a Student Management Platform being developed as an
enterprise engineering learning project.

The implementation approach is intentionally iterative:

> **Clarity over cleverness. Build the simplest clean solution first.
> The second implementation earns the abstraction.**

The roadmap is designed to progressively introduce:

- React and TypeScript engineering
- Feature-based frontend architecture
- API and application-layer design
- SOLID principles
- Clean Architecture
- Testing
- Database and distributed-system concepts
- Microservices
- Security, observability, resilience, CI/CD, and deployment
- System design and Forward Deployed Engineer skills

