### Important architectural decisions

Backend query behavior was separated into focused operations such as:

- `ApplySorting`
- `ApplyPaging`

Student-specific sort fields are represented through feature/application
constants.

Generic pagination and sorting abstractions were deliberately deferred.

> **The second implementation earns the abstraction.**

Status sorting was also deferred because the current global `IsDeleted`
filter does not provide meaningful business-status ordering. A future
Business Status Management story will address this properly.

