# Phase 6 --- Second Feature: Teachers

The Teacher feature is intentionally introduced before creating broad
shared abstractions.

Story Area Goal

---

ST-026 Teacher List Build Teacher list
ST-027 Teacher Query Features Search, pagination, and sorting
ST-028 Teacher Form Build Teacher form
ST-029 Teacher Validation Validate Teacher form
ST-030 Teacher Creation Create Teacher
ST-031 Teacher Management Details, edit, and lifecycle

## Why Teacher comes after Student

Student is our first real implementation.

Teacher becomes the second implementation.

For example:

```text
Student
  └── sorting / pagination

Teacher
  └── sorting / pagination
```

Only after seeing the second implementation will we evaluate whether a
shared abstraction is justified.

> **Do not design the abstraction from imagination. Let the second
> implementation prove it exists.**

